                            <li>Logo2 <a href="https://encrypted-tbn0.gstatic.com/images?q=tbn:ANd9GcT0FcRE3hfNOCn2D6h91_OkCc88D5MCuMd68h5cRv8LfA&s" class="color_main button_size">https://encrypted-tbn0.gstatic.com/...</a> <br></li>
